<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Progress Tracker</title>
<style>
    body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333333;
        margin: 40px;
    }
    h1 {
        color: #1a5276;
        border-bottom: 2.5px solid #1a5276;
        padding-bottom: 8px;
        font-size: 24pt;
        margin-top: 20px;
    }
    h2 {
        color: #2980b9;
        margin-top: 35px;
        border-bottom: 1.5px solid #ddd;
        padding-bottom: 5px;
        font-size: 18pt;
    }
    h3 {
        color: #2e86c1;
        font-size: 14pt;
        margin-top: 25px;
    }
    table {
        border-collapse: collapse;
        width: 100%;
        margin: 25px 0;
        font-size: 11pt;
    }
    th, td {
        border: 1px solid #cccccc;
        text-align: left;
        padding: 10px;
    }
    th {
        background-color: #f2f4f4;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #1a5276;
    }
    tr:nth-child(even) {
        background-color: #f8f9f9;
    }
    code {
        font-family: Consolas, Monaco, Courier, monospace;
        background-color: #f4f6f7;
        color: #c0392b;
        padding: 2px 5px;
        border-radius: 3px;
        font-size: 10pt;
    }
    pre {
        background-color: #f4f6f7;
        padding: 15px;
        border: 1px solid #d5dbdb;
        border-radius: 5px;
        overflow-x: auto;
        margin: 20px 0;
    }
    pre code {
        color: #333333;
        background-color: transparent;
        padding: 0;
    }
    blockquote {
        border-left: 5px solid #3498db;
        background-color: #ebf5fb;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        color: #2c3e50;
        font-style: italic;
    }
    ul, ol {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        padding-left: 30px;
    }
    li {
        margin-bottom: 5px;
    }
    hr {
        border: 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #d5dbdb;
        margin: 30px 0;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>📊 Thesis Progress Tracker &amp; Task List</h1>
<p>This file tracks the completed and remaining tasks for your Edge AI-powered Forest Acoustic Surveillance System. It is organized according to your 24-week A-to-Z thesis roadmap.</p>
<h2>📊 Quick Status Summary</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Total Project Tasks</strong>: 30</li>
<li><strong>Completed Tasks</strong>: 14 (47%)</li>
<li><strong>In Progress</strong>: 3 (10%)</li>
<li><strong>Pending Tasks</strong>: 13 (43%)</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>📅 Roadmap &amp; Task Checklist</h2>
<h3>📑 Task 1: Research, Architecture, &amp; Design (100% Completed)</h3>
<ul>
<li>[x] Draft end-to-end A-to-Z project plan <strong>README.md</strong></li>
<li>[x] Design electrical hardware wiring configurations <strong>wiring_guide.md</strong></li>
