<li>[x] Create detailed sub-class taxonomy, excluding boat engine classes <strong>sub_classes.md</strong></li>
<li>[x] Analyze distance attenuation physics &amp; design digital AGC <strong>distance_handling.md</strong></li>
<li>[x] Draft solar, battery, zoning, and GSM protocol design <strong>system_architecture.md</strong></li>
<li>[x] Conduct literature search on arXiv &amp; OpenAlex and write draft <strong>literature_review.md</strong></li>
</ul>
