</ul>
<h3>🐍 Task 3: Audio Preprocessing &amp; Web Scraping (75% Completed)</h3>
<ul>
<li>[x] Setup Python dependency definitions <strong>requirements.txt</strong></li>
<li>[x] Create automated YouTube audio downloader script <strong>download_youtube.py</strong></li>
<li>[x] Write WAV audio formatter/resampling script <strong>format_audio.py</strong></li>
<li>[/] Collect remaining rare classes (walkie-talkies, traps, drones) using YouTube scraper</li>
<li>[/] Run <code>format_audio.py</code> to convert all raw files to 16kHz, mono, 16-bit WAV</li>
</ul>
<h3>🧠 Task 4: TinyML Model Development (Pending)</h3>
<ul>
<li>[ ] Create an Edge Impulse project and upload the <code>formatted_data/</code> folder</li>
<li>[ ] Configure feature extraction blocks (MFE for mechanical noise, MFCC for vocal sweeps)</li>
<li>[ ] Train 2D Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) and review confusion matrix (Target: &gt;90% accuracy)</li>
<li>[ ] Quantize trained network to INT8 and export as optimized C++ Arduino library</li>
</ul>
<h3>🔌 Task 5: Hardware &amp; Firmware Prototyping (25% Completed)</h3>
<ul>
<li>[x] Create boilerplate ESP32-S3 deep sleep and I2S microphone sketch <strong>firmware.ino</strong></li>
<li>[ ] Wire the physical ESP32-S3, INMP441 Mic, LIS3DH Accelerometer, Neo-6M GPS, and SIM800L</li>
<li>[ ] Import Edge Impulse library into Arduino IDE and integrate with <code>firmware.ino</code></li>
<li>[ ] Implement digital AGC code and hierarchical two-stage anomaly inference</li>
<li>[ ] Implement SIM800L GSM AT commands to send alert SMS with GPS coordinates</li>
</ul>
<h3>🔋 Task 6: Power Optimization &amp; Casing (Pending)</h3>
<ul>
<li>[ ] Integrate CN3065 solar charge controller with 18650 LiFePO4 battery</li>
<li>[ ] Write firmware power management code (Deep Sleep duty-cycling and accelerometer interrupts)</li>
<li>[ ] Perform hardware power auditing (measure active vs. sleep current draw)</li>
<li>[ ] Design and 3D print a weatherproof IP67 camouflaged tree-mount casing</li>
</ul>
<h3>🌲 Task 7: Field Verification &amp; Testing (Pending)</h3>
<ul>
<li>[ ] Deploy prototype node high on a tree trunk in a local wooded area</li>
<li>[ ] Play target threat playbacks (chainsaws, gunshots) at varying distances (10m - 150m)</li>
<li>[ ] Log alert delivery latency, cellular signal strength, and detection accuracy</li>
<li>[ ] Run continuous solar-harvesting validation over a 7-day period</li>
</ul>
<h3>✍️ Task 8: Thesis Documentation &amp; Defense (Pending)</h3>
<ul>
